{"projectInfo":{"name":"分布式VXLAN IP网关配置举例（IPv4网络）","path":"vxlan_d_ip","visibility":2,"categoryId":51,"introduction":"Router A、Router C为分布式VXLAN IP网关设备，Router B为与广域网连接的边界网关设备，Internet为广域网内的三层设备。虚拟机VM 1属于VXLAN 10，VM 2属于VXLAN 20，VM 3属于VXLAN 30。通过分布式VXLAN IP网关实现不同VXLAN网络的三层互联，并通过边界网关实现与广域网的三层互联。具体需求为：不同VTEP之间手工建立VXLAN隧道。手工关联VXLAN和VXLAN隧道。站点之间的泛洪流量采用头端复制的方式转发。VM 1、VM 2、VM 3之间可以互访，且VM 1、VM 2和VM 3都可以访问外部网络。","label":["VXLAN","网关","VM"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"RTA","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTA.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTC","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTC.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTB","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTB.cfg"},{"resourceName":"P","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\P.cfg"},{"resourceName":"Internet","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\Internet.cfg"},{"resourceName":"VM2","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\VM2.cfg"},{"resourceName":"VM3","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\VM3.cfg"},{"resourceName":"VM1","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\VM1.cfg"}]}